<title>SRI LANKA: CRICKET-SRI LANKA V ZIMBABWE SCOREBOARD.</title>
<headline>CRICKET-SRI LANKA V ZIMBABWE SCOREBOARD.</headline>
<dateline>COLOMBO 1996-09-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Scoreboard on the fourth day of</p>
<p>the first test between Sri Lanka and Zimbabwe on Saturday:</p>
<p>Sri Lanka first innings 349 (A.Ranatunga 75, A.Gurusinha 52;</p>
<p>P.Strang 5-106)</p>
<p>Zimbabwe first innings 145 (C.Wishart 51; C.Vaas 4-73,</p>
<p>J.Silva 3-10)</p>
<p>Zimbabwe second innings (overnight 20-0)</p>
<p> G.Flower b Muralitharan		   27</p>
<p> M.Dekker c Jayasuriya b Dharmasena    20</p>
<p> C.Wishart b Silva			    3</p>
<p>A.Campbell c Mahanama b Muralitharan  26</p>
<p> A.Flower c Mahanama b Muralitharan     0</p>
<p> G.Whittall c Mahanama b Silva	   13</p>
<p> C.Evans lbw b Silva			  1</p>
<p> P.Strang c Vaas b Muralitharan	   8</p>
<p> H.Olonga c Mahanama b Silva		0</p>
<p> A.Whittall b Muralitharan		 11</p>
<p> H.Streak not out			     3</p>
<p> Extras (b-6 lb-4 w-1 nb-4)		15</p>
<p> Toal					   127</p>
<p>Fall of wickets: 1-35 2-42 3-65 4-65 5-98 6-99 7-102 8-102</p>
<p>9-113</p>
<p>Bowling: Vaas 12-1-34-0, Gurusinha 2-0-4-0 (1w), De Silva</p>
<p>2-1-1-0, Dharmasena 14-7-19-1, Silva 19-12-25-4 (1nb),</p>
<p>Muralitharan 20.3-4-33-5 (3nb), Jayasuriya 4-3-1-0</p>
<p>Result: Sri Lanka won by an innings and 77 runs</p>
<p>Second test: Colombo, September 17-21</p>
</text>
